                        ],
                        "form": "die Dickhäuter"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37f9b66b-fc7b-3fa0-87c5-539f2c4b2570",
                        "entry_id": "a444d07f-92b7-39f0-8249-a0d0edf57d10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "großes Huftier mit ledriger Haut"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51d416af-9b63-44f5-b759-86b7f13e3e45",
                                "sense_id": "37f9b66b-fc7b-3fa0-87c5-539f2c4b2570",
                                "text": "„Dazu berichtete Harscher von der Geschichte, die die Einheimischen über die riesigen Dickhäuter erzählen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6682492-8891-4434-8676-5967b09788ea",
                                "sense_id": "37f9b66b-fc7b-3fa0-87c5-539f2c4b2570",
                                "text": "„Die gelehrigen Dickhäuter bildeten in dem unwegsamen Dschungel eine unschätzbare Hilfe, zumal sie im ausgewachsenen Zustand außer dem Menschen keine natürlichen Feinde haben.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "539d3fb7-c04a-40f2-b8e1-5519d6b05d50",
                                "sense_id": "37f9b66b-fc7b-3fa0-87c5-539f2c4b2570",
                                "text": "„Als würden die Dickhäuter von ihrem Tempo aus der Kurve getragen, preschten sie auf den Betrachter zu.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0150ad8-2185-3c72-a41a-d2b1076e2ab7",
                        "entry_id": "a444d07f-92b7-39f0-8249-a0d0edf57d10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "gleichgültiger Mensch"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figurative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4147644a-b894-404f-aa02-fe6efaf02f51",
                                "sense_id": "c0150ad8-2185-3c72-a41a-d2b1076e2ab7",
                                "text": "„Männerkosmetik: Pflege für Dickhäuter und Bartträger“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2d84805-0cc4-4403-abc3-da080d00ebe4",
                        "source_entry_id": "a444d07f-92b7-39f0-8249-a0d0edf57d10",
                        "source_sense_id": "37f9b66b-fc7b-3fa0-87c5-539f2c4b2570",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zoologie: großes Huftier mit ledriger Haut",
                        "target_lang_word": "pachyderm",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pachyderm",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55611190-ebf1-32da-9cad-1d8b8e165d64",
                                        "entry_id": "adab1fd9-4662-3fe5-8dd2-5c726872b1b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the obsolete taxonomic order Pachydermata, grouping of thick-skinned, hoofed animals such as the rhinoceros, hippopotamus, elephant and tapir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba05b010-b947-369a-96f0-5d5fe58a6250",
                                        "entry_id": "adab1fd9-4662-3fe5-8dd2-5c726872b1b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An elephant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39c786c9-d367-4188-b3e2-df287789df67",
                                                "sense_id": "ba05b010-b947-369a-96f0-5d5fe58a6250",
                                                "text": "And so it happened that before the elephant realized that his new enemy had leaped from his path Tarzan had driven his iron-shod spear from behind the massive shoulder straight into the fierce heart, and the colossal pachyderm had toppled to his death at the feet of the ape-man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56a9b559-ec3e-41d1-8648-54a160345e3e",
                                                "sense_id": "ba05b010-b947-369a-96f0-5d5fe58a6250",
                                                "text": "Among five score pachyderm / Each canopied and passengered / Sit the duke and the duchess' luscious young girls"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d4b41c1-2aa3-455b-9256-547f16832c3f",
                                                "sense_id": "ba05b010-b947-369a-96f0-5d5fe58a6250",
                                                "text": "In September 2008[…] Portfolio rented an elephant to illustrate an article about JPMorgan Chase’s credit derivatives desk, because the editors had decided on the headline “The $58 Trillion Elephant in the Room.” Condé spent about $30,000 photographing the pachyderm, instead of using a stock image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28d3be58-c0fa-3d8d-b02e-5db11435f28b",
                                        "entry_id": "adab1fd9-4662-3fe5-8dd2-5c726872b1b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with thick skin; someone who is not affected by or does not care what others say about them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb576fee-472d-33e7-b0a6-b2db4855f162",
                                        "entry_id": "adab1fd9-4662-3fe5-8dd2-5c726872b1b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who is insensitive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eca1a9a7-77ff-47a7-9f50-ba231892d5d0",
                        "source_entry_id": "a444d07f-92b7-39f0-8249-a0d0edf57d10",
                        "source_sense_id": "37f9b66b-fc7b-3fa0-87c5-539f2c4b2570",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zoologie: großes Huftier mit ledriger Haut",
                        "target_lang_word": "pachyderme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pachyderme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40ff5392-d597-3441-8ce7-6921131decd8",
                                        "entry_id": "87bdc5f7-d5a4-32b8-8b22-521406e303a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a la peau épaisse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7d6bbc6-f871-4676-a957-f405819e2e19",
                                                "sense_id": "40ff5392-d597-3441-8ce7-6921131decd8",
                                                "text": "Un quadrupède pachyderme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pachyderme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba0601f3-2ea7-3294-a4ed-22bb8e152b0c",
                                        "entry_id": "f07bd16b-f588-3aa9-9fff-313250e63a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Animal mammifère qui a la peau très épaisse et les pieds terminés par des sabots."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Histoire naturelle"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a7ef3ca-0dfc-44a3-a4d4-0755d12b41d7",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0601f3-2ea7-3294-a4ed-22bb8e152b0c",
                                                "text": "Les bêtes présentaient beaucoup d’analogies avec celles de la Terre. Il y avait des félins, des pachydermes, des ruminants, des reptiles et des oiseaux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bac5091-fb88-4720-b491-2d25c99559da",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0601f3-2ea7-3294-a4ed-22bb8e152b0c",
                                                "text": "L’éléphant, le rhinocéros et l’hippopotame sont des pachydermes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9f97bb4-1c1e-3d38-8701-77e421ee41e4",
                                        "entry_id": "f07bd16b-f588-3aa9-9fff-313250e63a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Éléphant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ebf24c1-99e3-42fa-9d86-cf6a3e859106",
                                                "sense_id": "c9f97bb4-1c1e-3d38-8701-77e421ee41e4",
                                                "text": "Une harde de pachydermes s’avançait d’un lourd balancement, dans un concert de grognements paisibles qui ne semblait nullement menaçant. Parfois un barrissement tonitruant s’élevait au-dessus du troupeau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6285df75-a258-3f6c-b0d5-2d5941d2fb9d",
                                        "entry_id": "f07bd16b-f588-3aa9-9fff-313250e63a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne lourde (au sens figuré)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66e3f568-dc9d-44c9-af15-474be5ece931",
                                                "sense_id": "6285df75-a258-3f6c-b0d5-2d5941d2fb9d",
                                                "text": "L’Homo Occidentalus est un gros pachyderme gâté pourri. Un préado de 12 ans qui menace d’appeler la DPJ dès qu’on lui demande de mettre son assiette dans le lave-vaisselle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
